    "encrypted": "false",
    "display_name": "Add the Trigger Button",
    "long_instructions": "# Add the Trigger Button\r\n\r\n**Goal:** Add a button to each card that will control the reveal interaction.\r\n\r\n1. **Update Your Card Template:** Modify your card rendering code to include a button element inside each card.\r\n\r\n2. **Choose Button Text:** Decide what your button will say, such as \"See More\", \"Reveal\", or something specific to your app.\r\n\r\n3. **Place the Button Intentionally:** Position the button so it clearly relates to the card content.\r\n\r\n4. **Confirm Each Card Has Its Own Button:** Make sure the button is generated inside your .map() loop so every card has one.",
    "bubble_choice_description": "Add a \"See More\" or \"Reveal\" button to each card so users can trigger additional information without reloading the page. ***(supports completing Milestone 2 tasks)***",
